<ul>
<li>There are more than 1,000 hospitality and culinary employees in the Lake Tahoe Basin</li>
<li>1,000 new hospitality and culinary positions are projected in the next 5 years</li>
<li>6,000 hospitality and culinary employees are located on Tahoe's South Shore</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
